This product bundles glyph outline data derived from the following font,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1:

  Inter 4.1
    Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
    Licence: src/gspg/assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt

The derived data lives in src/gspg/assets/fonts/*.glyphs.json and is produced by
tools/build_glyphpack.py from the archives pinned in src/gspg/assets/fonts/fonts.lock.json.
It contains glyph outlines, advance widths and kerning pairs, and is covered by
the OFL exactly as the fonts it comes from are.
